# Project Architecture

This is an online multiplayer Mafia game built with **Next.js 15 (App Router)**, **Convex** (backend/database), **LiveKit** (WebRTC video/audio), **TailwindCSS + shadcn/ui**, and **TypeScript** (strict mode).

## Folder Structure

```
online-mafia/
├── src/
│   ├── app/                      # Next.js App Router (pages & layouts ONLY)
│   │   └── api/auth/             # Auth bridge API routes
│   ├── components/               # React components (organized by feature)
│   │   ├── ui/                   # shadcn/ui primitives
│   │   ├── game/                 # In-game components
│   │   ├── gameSession/          # Game session components
│   │   ├── lobby/                # Lobby components
│   │   ├── auth/                 # Auth components
│   │   ├── dashboard/            # Dashboard components
│   │   ├── liveKit/              # LiveKit video/audio components
│   │   ├── participant/          # Player participant components
│   │   ├── host-controls/        # Host control panel components
│   │   ├── modals/               # Modal components
│   │   └── providers/            # ConvexClientProvider, etc.
│   ├── hooks/                    # Custom React hooks
│   │   ├── auth/                 # Auth hooks
│   │   ├── game/                 # Game state hooks
│   │   ├── livekit/              # LiveKit hooks
│   │   └── participant/          # Participant hooks
│   ├── lib/                      # Utilities, constants, context
│   │   ├── constants/game.ts     # Game phases, roles, statuses
│   │   ├── game/visibility.ts    # Role-based visibility logic (pure functions)
│   │   ├── time/serverTime.ts    # useServerTime() — server-corrected clock
│   │   ├── context/              # React contexts
│   │   ├── auth/                 # Auth utilities
│   │   └── liveKit/              # LiveKit utilities
│   ├── middlewares/              # Middleware helpers
│   └── middleware.ts             # Next.js root middleware
├── convex/                       # ALL backend logic
│   ├── schema.ts                 # Database schema (single source of truth)
│   ├── _generated/               # Auto-generated (NEVER edit)
│   ├── auth.config.ts            # Convex Auth config
│   ├── auth/                     # Auth functions
│   ├── game/                     # Game phase logic
│   ├── lobby/                    # Lobby functions
│   ├── tables/                   # Per-table queries/mutations
│   ├── refs/                     # Reference data
│   └── lib/                      # Shared server-side helpers
└── docs/                         # Full documentation (read before implementing)
```

## Strict Rules

1. **All game logic in Convex** — `mutation` for writes, `query` for reads, `internalAction` for LiveKit calls
2. **No component code in `app/`** — pages are thin wrappers only; all UI lives in `components/`
3. **No business logic in components** — logic lives in `hooks/` or `convex/`
4. **Feature-based grouping** — group by feature, not by type
5. **Server-corrected time** — use `useServerTime()` from `src/lib/time/serverTime.ts` for any timer math; never raw `Date.now()`

## Naming Conventions

| Item | Convention | Example |
|------|-----------|---------|
| Component files | PascalCase | `PlayerCard.tsx` |
| Hook files | camelCase with `use` prefix | `useGamePhase.ts` |
| Utility files | camelCase | `formatTime.ts` |
| Convex functions | camelCase | `gameSessions.ts` |
| Types/interfaces | PascalCase, no `I` prefix | `GamePlayer`, `GameRole` |
| Constants | UPPER_SNAKE_CASE | `MAX_PLAYERS` |
| Route folders | kebab-case | `game-room/` |

Always use the `@/` path alias. Never use relative imports going more than one level up.
